OL,3,GNEWSAAncient forest recommended for
OL,4,AUnesco global status
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ancient landscape in Leicestershire
OL,7,Fhas been shortlisted to be given
OL,8,Fspecial recognition by Unesco.
OL,10,FCharnwood Forest, which is widely
OL,11,Frecognised for its rich geology, has
OL,12,Ftaken shape over millions of years and
OL,13,Fwas one of Sir David Attenborough's
OL,14,Fchildhood highlights.
OL,16,FAn application to become a Unesco
OL,17,FGlobal Geopark, led by The National
OL,18,FForest, was submitted last year and
OL,19,Fevaluators visited the area - which
OL,20,Fincludes Bradgate Park, Beacon Hill,
OL,21,FGrace Dieu Priory, Hill Hole, Billa
OL,22,FBarra and Sandham Bridge - in August.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
