OL,3,GNEWSAAncient forest recommended for
OL,4,AUnesco global status
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow the Unesco Global Geopark Council
OL,7,Fhas said it is among 11 sites
OL,8,Frecommended to receive the designation,
OL,9,Fwith the final decision due to be made
OL,10,Fnext April.
